{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"᥈ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ","commonName":"᥈ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ","title":"ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤋᤡᤔᤥᤌᤡ᤺ᤴ ᤜᤠᤰᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤏᤡᤛᤡᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"9e76648f9bca2375f88920d323e178cdb2e0317a340e6114719058916d4d4896","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":81},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤜᤠᤱ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤛᤧ ᤕᤢ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤜᤡᤱᤘᤧᤳ ᤏᤢ ᤁᤢᤛᤡᤘᤧᤳ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤂᤠᤛᤧᤴ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤛᤡ᤹ᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤏᤢ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤖᤧ ᤂᤢᤴᤇᤡ᤹ ᤋᤃᤡ ᤀᤡᤱᤈᤠ᤺ᤱ ᤐᤡᤏᤧᤖᤥ–"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤓᤥ᤺ᤛᤧ᤹॥ ᤀᤠᤵᤑᤠᤸᤗᤧᤛᤠᤱ ᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ ᤛᤧ᤺ᤔᤠ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ᤃ ᤕᤠᤖᤡᤵ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤜᤠᤱᤃᤧᤶᤛᤡᤱᤗ ᤏᤡᤛᤠᤶᤏᤢ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤢ᤺ᤖᤡᤰᤁᤠᤱ ᤂᤠᤜᤢᤴ ᤐᤡᤖᤧᤛᤧ᤹. ᤑᤧ᤺ᤰᤋᤧᤛᤧ᤹. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤜᤠᤱᤜᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤳᤋᤧᤛᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤌᤣᤀᤠᤱᤓᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠ ᤏᤡᤛᤠᤶ ᤂᤧᤶᤔᤠ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤛᤡᤖᤠ᤹ ᤔᤧᤴᤎᤠᤱᤔᤏᤠ ᤕᤧᤶ ᤋᤠᤖ ᤐᤳ॥ ᤁᤖ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧᤃ ᤀᤠᤒᤠᤅᤣ ᤕᤠᤶᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤀᤥ ᤔᤧᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤁᤠᤱ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤂᤧᤶᤔᤠ ᤛᤡᤖᤠ᤹ ᤁᤧᤎᤠᤱᤒᤠ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤗᤰ ᤂᤧᤶᤔᤠ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤒᤠ ᤜᤧᤰᤋᤱᤒᤠ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤧᤒᤠ᤺ᤵᤐᤠ ᤛᤡᤰᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤔᤧᤗᤢᤵᤛᤢᤛᤡᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧᤃ ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠᤒᤠ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤏᤠ᤹ᤖᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤁᤢᤒᤢᤱᤏᤠ ᤁᤢᤛᤶᤒᤠ ᤂᤧᤍᤠ᤹ᤜᤠ᤹ ᤗᤧᤵᤔᤠᤱ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤔᤧᤒᤡᤖᤢ᤹ᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ᤃ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤐᤖᤡᤰᤐᤠ ᤘᤠᤏᤠᤶᤔᤥ ᤜᤠᤱᤜᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤧ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤋᤢᤰᤂᤣ᤺ᤴ ᤌᤖᤧ᤹. ᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ ᤛᤧ᤺ᤛ᤻ᤛᤧ᤹. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ ᤔᤠᤱᤛᤣᤘᤠ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤔᤠ ᤁᤧᤕᤠ᤺ᤶᤒᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤆᤥᤃᤧ ᤛ